Dialogue: 0,00:10:24.08,00:10:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,because it is 10 months old.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:26.00,00:10:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the insight is not the performance, the insight is the RECIPE.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:31.68,00:10:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The recipe is basically this. So, what happens is8i999gggggggb=
Dialogue: 0,00:10:36.32,00:10:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you take a repo
Dialogue: 0,00:10:38.80,00:10:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,like letter you have any benchmark for
Dialogue: 0,00:10:40.84,00:10:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,or any task. Take that repo, and
Dialogue: 0,00:10:43.84,00:10:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you create an environmen. The environment is
Dialogue: 0,00:10:47.04,00:10:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,basically an execution which gives feedback to
Dialogue: 0,00:10:48.92,00:10:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the agent. And, after that
Dialogue: 0,00:10:54.08,00:10:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you created Tests. These tests
Dialogue: 0,00:10:56.76,00:11:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,are supposed to be extremely
Dialogue: 0,00:11:00.60,00:11:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,expressive.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:03.52,00:11:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, writing a very good test suite
Dialogue: 0,00:11:05.56,00:11:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,is basically your insight - your moat.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:10.36,00:11:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- to actually doing automation.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:12.84,00:11:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can tell the agent-
Dialogue: 0,00:11:14.12,00:11:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,whether you're trying to orchestrate
Dialogue: 0,00:11:16.56,00:11:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,like a bunch of DevOps tasks or
Dialogue: 0,00:11:19.24,00:11:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,let's say CI/SD pipelines or, let's say
Dialogue: 0,00:11:21.64,00:11:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you're trying to write some very specific code,
Dialogue: 0,00:11:23.16,00:11:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,for a very specific client with
Dialogue: 0,00:11:25.76,00:11:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,some SLAs, your objective is to
Dialogue: 0,00:11:28.56,00:11:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,write tests in such scrutiny that
Dialogue: 0,00:11:32.80,00:11:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,it should tell
Dialogue: 0,00:11:34.24,00:11:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the Agent what is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:36.72,00:11:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And, the agent is smart enough to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:38.28,00:11:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, tests. Write the tests!
Dialogue: 0,00:11:40.36,00:11:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the 4th point
Dialogue: 0,00:11:42.84,00:11:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,is basically - once you have written the
Dialogue: 0,00:11:44.56,00:11:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,first three things, what you can
Dialogue: 0,00:11:46.20,00:11:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,do is :
Dialogue: 0,00:11:47.84,00:11:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask an AI/LLM Model
Dialogue: 0,00:11:50.60,00:11:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,able to able to make changes into it
Dialogue: 0,00:11:52.52,00:11:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, do mutations on let's say- whether the function
