Dialogue: 0,00:12:00.44,00:12:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,extreme and then you can create like
Dialogue: 0,00:12:02.32,00:12:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,of a bunch of tasks
Dialogue: 0,00:12:05.08,00:12:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,for your repo, and then-
Dialogue: 0,00:12:06.80,00:12:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have a 32B
